<title>HUNGARY: Bonbon 1996 pre-tax loss 3.1 mln forints.</title>
<headline>Bonbon 1996 pre-tax loss 3.1 mln forints.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					    1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Operating result		  11.1 loss  vs	8.8 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		     3.1 loss  vs	4.6 profit</p>
<p>    Net sales			  717.5	 vs    865.9</p>
<p>    Other revenues		    28.6	 vs     44.5</p>
<p>Purchasing cost on</p>
<p>	goods sold		     489.5	 vs    606.3</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	     267.7	 vs    312.7</p>
<p>    Financial result		   8.3	 vs	6.4</p>
<p>    Extraordinary result	     0.4	 vs	7.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are non-consolidated and were calculated according to the Hungarian accounting standard. The figures for 1996 ar unaudited. Full company name is Bonbon Hemingway Kereskedelmi Rt. Bonbon is a confectionery retail chain.</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
